    "hypothesis": "The convolution kernel's grid-stride loop is missing, so only a subset of output elements are computed when the grid size is capped at 65535 blocks. The actual output has many zeros because the kernel only covers the first 65535*256 elements, but the total output size is 130056192. The diagnostic report shows a high mismatch at step_001 (conv output), confirming the issue originates in conv2d_forward.",
